_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQI6s3zum9OyamiRQJEAScmVXcIT5J_mgNy0hyiQInkDA&oe=6AF494E8"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "VR Doctor's Office", "keywords": ["DoctorSimulator", "MedicalTraining", "KidsVR", "CareerExperience", "EducationalGame"], "long_description": "**\u201c**VR Doctor's Office**\u201d is a gentle, child-friendly VR game that lets kids experience what it\u2019s like to be a doctor.**\n\nYou listen to the patient, perform simple examinations, and think about what might be causing the symptoms.\n\nNo medical knowledge needed!\n\nThe adorable trainee doctor **Chiyo Kannagi** guides players with voice navigation, so even first-timers can enjoy the experience with confidence.\n\nThe game features three carefully selected, easy-to-understand cases.\n\nWith a soft, non-scary visual style and clear step-by-step guidance, children can have fun exploring **what a doctor\u2019s job is really like.**\n\n**\u201cSo this is what doctors do!\u201d**\n\nA new, exciting medical VR experience designed just for kids.", "short_description": "**\u201cVR Doctor's Office\u201d lets children experience what it\u2019s like to be a doctor in a friendly, hands-on VR setting.**\n\nKids call in patients, ask simple questions, perform basic exams, and learn to think about diagnoses \u2014 all guided by an adorable trainee doctor.\n\nWith three beginner-friendly cases, even first-time users can enjoy discovering\n\n**\u201cThis is what doctors do!\u201d**"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://app.berise.co.jp/vr-shisatsushitsu/privacy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "\u682a\u5f0f\u4f1a\u793e\u30d3\u30fc\u30e9\u30a4\u30ba", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://berise.co.jp/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"},